{"seq":4,"slug":"chat-platform-onboarding","title":"OpenClaw chat-platform 接入","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/chat-platform-onboarding","wordCount":889,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"openclaw-chat-platform-接入\">OpenClaw chat-platform 接入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OpenClaw 本体跑起来后，下一步是把 persona 接到具体的 chat platform——飞书 / Slack / Telegram / Discord 等。接入分三个动作：OAuth 授权 → webhook 配置 → 第一条路由规则。本节以飞书为主、Slack / Telegram 简要带过，让读者拿到 hands-on 的最小可路由链路。路由规则按 <strong>peer → parent → guild/roles → account → channel → fallback</strong> 多级 lookup 解析，可读且可审计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  msg[Incoming Message] --&gt; lookup[多级 Lookup]&#10;  lookup --&gt; p1[peer 匹配]&#10;  p1 --&gt;|不匹配| p2[parent 匹配]&#10;  p2 --&gt;|不匹配| p3[guild/roles 匹配]&#10;  p3 --&gt;|不匹配| p4[account 匹配]&#10;  p4 --&gt;|不匹配| p5[channel 匹配]&#10;  p5 --&gt;|不匹配| fb[fallback persona]&#10;  p1 --&gt;|匹配| route[路由到 persona]&#10;  p2 --&gt;|匹配| route&#10;  p3 --&gt;|匹配| route&#10;  p4 --&gt;|匹配| route&#10;  p5 --&gt;|匹配| route&#10;  fb --&gt; route\">flowchart LR\n  msg[Incoming Message] --&gt; lookup[多级 Lookup]\n  lookup --&gt; p1[peer 匹配]\n  p1 --&gt;|不匹配| p2[parent 匹配]\n  p2 --&gt;|不匹配| p3[guild/roles 匹配]\n  p3 --&gt;|不匹配| p4[account 匹配]\n  p4 --&gt;|不匹配| p5[channel 匹配]\n  p5 --&gt;|不匹配| fb[fallback persona]\n  p1 --&gt;|匹配| route[路由到 persona]\n  p2 --&gt;|匹配| route\n  p3 --&gt;|匹配| route\n  p4 --&gt;|匹配| route\n  p5 --&gt;|匹配| route\n  fb --&gt; route</pre><h2 id=\"oauth-授权-以飞书为例\">OAuth 授权：以飞书为例</h2><p>飞书接入分三步（其它平台流程类似）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"step-1-在飞书开放平台创建应用\">Step 1: 在飞书开放平台创建应用</h3><p>进入飞书开放平台，新建一个 Custom App（不是 ISV App）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>应用名建议带 persona 后缀，如 <code>OpenClaw-dev</code>；</li>\n<li>启用&quot;机器人&quot;能力；</li>\n<li>在&quot;权限管理&quot;里开 <code>im:message</code>、<code>im:message.group_at_msg</code>、<code>im:chat:readonly</code> 三个 scope；</li>\n<li>在&quot;事件订阅&quot;里先<strong>留空 URL</strong>，等下一步 OpenClaw 端起 webhook 再填回；</li>\n<li>拿到 <code>App ID</code> 与 <code>App Secret</code>，下一步用。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"step-2-在-openclaw-里注册-chat-platform\">Step 2: 在 OpenClaw 里注册 chat platform</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"openclaw chat-platform add feishu \\&#10;  --persona dev \\&#10;  --app-id cli_xxxxx \\&#10;  --app-secret xxxxxxxxxxxx\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chat-platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feishu</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --persona</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --app-id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cli_xxxxx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --app-secret</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> xxxxxxxxxxxx</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注册后 OpenClaw 会启动一个 webhook listener，默认监听 <code>:8080/webhook/feishu/&lt;persona&gt;</code>。把这个 URL 填回飞书开放平台的&quot;事件订阅&quot;，飞书会发一个 challenge 请求做校验，OpenClaw 自动响应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"step-3-验证-oauth-webhook-链路\">Step 3: 验证 OAuth + webhook 链路</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"openclaw chat-platform status --persona dev\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chat-platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --persona</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出里看到 <code>feishu: oauth=ok, webhook=verified, last-event=&lt;timestamp&gt;</code> 即接入成功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"slack-telegram-简要差异\">Slack / Telegram 简要差异</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>OAuth 形式</th>\n<th>webhook 模型</th>\n<th>路由元数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>飞书</td>\n<td>Custom App + App ID/Secret</td>\n<td>webhook listener</td>\n<td>tenant_key / chat_id / open_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slack</td>\n<td>Bot User OAuth Token</td>\n<td>Events API webhook</td>\n<td>team_id / channel_id / user_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Telegram</td>\n<td>Bot Token</td>\n<td>Long-polling 或 webhook</td>\n<td>chat_id / from.id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discord</td>\n<td>Bot Token + Gateway</td>\n<td>WebSocket gateway</td>\n<td>guild_id / channel_id / user_id</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OpenClaw 把这四类元数据 normalize 成统一的 (peer, parent, guild, roles, account, channel) 六元组，路由规则只针对六元组写，不需关心平台具体字段——这是 OpenClaw 路由层抽象的核心价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第一条路由规则\">第一条路由规则</h2><p>接入完成后，所有 incoming message 都会进 fallback persona（默认 = 注册时指定的 persona）。这显然不够；下一步是写第一条显式规则。</p>\n<p>编辑 <code>~/.openclaw/personas/dev/routes.yaml</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"routes:&#10;  - name: &#39;team-eng-channel-to-dev&#39;&#10;    match:&#10;      platform: feishu&#10;      channel: oc_xxxxx_eng_review&#10;    persona: dev&#10;    action: deliver&#10;&#10;  - name: &#39;personal-dm-from-mentor&#39;&#10;    match:&#10;      platform: feishu&#10;      peer: ou_yyyyy_mentor_id&#10;    persona: dev&#10;    action: deliver&#10;    priority: high&#10;&#10;  - name: &#39;spam-channel-mute&#39;&#10;    match:&#10;      platform: feishu&#10;      channel: oc_zzzzz_random_chat&#10;    action: mute\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">routes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'team-eng-channel-to-dev'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">feishu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">oc_xxxxx_eng_review</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deliver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal-dm-from-mentor'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">feishu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      peer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ou_yyyyy_mentor_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deliver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">high</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spam-channel-mute'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">feishu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">oc_zzzzz_random_chat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mute</span></span></code></pre></div><p>加载新规则不需要重启：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"openclaw route reload --persona dev\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> route</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reload</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --persona</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>openclaw route list --persona dev</code> 可以看当前生效的规则列表，便于审查覆盖关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多级-lookup-语法详解\">多级 lookup 语法详解</h2><p>路由规则的 <code>match</code> 段支持六级字段，按 <strong>peer → parent → guild/roles → account → channel → fallback</strong> 顺序求值。理解这个顺序至关重要——前面命中后就不再尝试后续。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"match:&#10;  peer: ou_yyyy # 第 1 级：具体某人 DM&#10;  parent: ou_xxxx # 第 2 级：parent peer（如线程父节点）&#10;  guild: g_xxxx # 第 3 级：guild 级（Discord guild / Slack workspace）&#10;  roles: [&#39;admin&#39;] # 同级：role 匹配&#10;  account: a_xxxx # 第 4 级：account 级&#10;  channel: c_xxxx # 第 5 级：channel 级&#10;  # 不写则进入 fallback\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  peer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ou_yyyy</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 第 1 级：具体某人 DM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  parent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ou_xxxx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 第 2 级：parent peer（如线程父节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  guild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">g_xxxx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 第 3 级：guild 级（Discord guild / Slack workspace）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  roles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 同级：role 匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  account</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">a_xxxx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 第 4 级：account 级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">c_xxxx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 第 5 级：channel 级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 不写则进入 fallback</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实际写规则的建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>粒度越细 priority 越高</strong>：peer 级规则覆盖 channel 级。</li>\n<li><strong>fallback 一定要有</strong>：否则 unmatched message 直接落到 audit log 里、agent 看不到。</li>\n<li><strong>mute 类规则放最前</strong>：避免 spam channel 的消息误触发 agent 推理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"coding-agent-通过-reverse-mcp-操作路由\">coding agent 通过 reverse MCP 操作路由</h2><p>接入完成后，coding agent（如 Claude Code）能调用三类 tool：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"- openclaw.persona.switch(persona)         # 切换当前 active persona&#10;- openclaw.message.send(channel, text)     # 以 active persona 发消息&#10;- openclaw.route.list(persona)             # 列当前 persona 的路由规则\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>- openclaw.persona.switch(persona)         # 切换当前 active persona</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- openclaw.message.send(channel, text)     # 以 active persona 发消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- openclaw.route.list(persona)             # 列当前 persona 的路由规则</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型场景：在 Claude Code 里完成一段代码 review 后，让 agent 调 <code>openclaw.message.send</code> 把 review 摘要发到 <code>oc_xxxxx_eng_review</code> 频道——OpenClaw 自动用 dev persona 的 identity 与 signature。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>OAuth scope 不全</strong>：忘开 <code>im:message.group_at_msg</code> 时机器人收不到群消息；现象是 webhook 一直没 event。</li>\n<li><strong>webhook URL 填错或没公网</strong>：开放平台校验失败；本地开发用 ngrok 等工具暴露公网 URL。</li>\n<li><strong>fallback 漏写</strong>：unmatched message 沉到 audit log 里；agent 无感知，问题不易暴露。</li>\n<li><strong>多 persona 共用 webhook 端口</strong>：默认 <code>:8080</code> 全 tenant 共享；多 persona 同时跑要 reverse-proxy 区分 path。</li>\n<li><strong>App Secret 写进 git</strong>：经典 leak；用环境变量或 OpenClaw 内置 keychain（macOS）/ libsecret（Linux）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>接入分三步：OAuth 授权 → webhook 配置 → 第一条路由规则。</li>\n<li>飞书 / Slack / Telegram / Discord 平台字段不同，OpenClaw 归一化成六元组（peer/parent/guild/roles/account/channel）。</li>\n<li>路由规则 yaml 可读、可 reload、可审计；优先级按&quot;粒度细 &gt; priority 高&quot;。</li>\n<li>coding agent 通过 reverse MCP 拿到 persona.switch / message.send / route.list 三类 tool。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"deployment-modes\"><code>5_deployment-modes.md</code></a> 对比四种部署形态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenClaw chat-platform 接入","id":"openclaw-chat-platform-接入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OAuth 授权：以飞书为例","id":"oauth-授权-以飞书为例"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 1: 在飞书开放平台创建应用","id":"step-1-在飞书开放平台创建应用"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 2: 在 OpenClaw 里注册 chat platform","id":"step-2-在-openclaw-里注册-chat-platform"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 3: 验证 OAuth + webhook 链路","id":"step-3-验证-oauth-webhook-链路"},{"level":2,"text":"Slack / Telegram 简要差异","id":"slack-telegram-简要差异"},{"level":2,"text":"第一条路由规则","id":"第一条路由规则"},{"level":2,"text":"多级 lookup 语法详解","id":"多级-lookup-语法详解"},{"level":2,"text":"coding agent 通过 reverse MCP 操作路由","id":"coding-agent-通过-reverse-mcp-操作路由"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenClaw 安装与首次 tenant 创建","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/install-and-first-tenant"},"next":{"title":"OpenClaw 四种部署形态","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/deployment-modes"}}